1: # 技能模块时间线重构方案
2: 
3: > 记录时间：2026-10-28  
4: > 状态：P0/P1 主体代码已落地，客户端 `Assembly-CSharp`、服务器 `PECommon` 编译通过；待 Unity 实机联调  
5: > 目标：把现有「每类技能一个 System + 四段状态机 + 技能内 CD」重构为「按需释放 + 时间线」  
6: > 路径约定：客户端根 = `D:\sixgod\gitproject\test\Code\Demo\Assets\Scripts`
7: 
8: ---
9: 
10: ## 0. 最终结论
11: 
12: 1. **技能按需释放**：提供 `SkillService`，任何 Entity 都可以调用 `UseSkill` 使用技能；每次释放创建一个临时施法实体，时间线播完自动销毁。
13: 2. **技能内部不再有 CD/状态机**：删除 `SkillCDComponent`、`SkillState`、前摇/持续/后摇组件；时间线只负责一次释放。
14: 3. **自动释放单独配置**：`Skill.xlsx` 增加 `autoUse` 字段。  
15:    - `autoUse = 1`：由 `SkillAutoCastSystem` 按 `cd` 循环自动调用 `UseSkill`（图腾、蛇身、Boss 的旧自动技能靠这个保留）。  
16:    - `autoUse = 0`：代码不自动释放，完全由行为树/其他系统调用 `UseSkill`。
17: 4. **配置精简**：删除 `areaFilter / areaFilterCount / areaShape / teamType`，新增通用 `param` 键值字段；每种技能类型自己解析需要的参数。
18: 5. **阵型旋转默认关闭**：`isRotate` 字段默认 `false`，预览、阵型生成、范围判定统一使用。
19: 6. **打断**：施法者死亡、被困、石化时立即终止施法。
20: 7. **单格阵型**：`areaShape <= 0` 按单格处理。
21: 
22: ---
23: 
24: ## 1. 现有系统盘点
25: 
26: ### 1.1 现有能力
27: 
28: | 能力 | 现有实现 |
29: |---|---|
30: | 技能实体 | `EntityFactoryService.CreateSkillEntity`，每个技能常驻一个 Entity |
31: | 冷却/状态机 | `SkillCDComponent` + `SkillState`（Ready/CD/前摇/Doing/后摇） |
32: | 阵型 | `Skill_ShapeSystem` → `SkillLogic.AddShape` → `ShapeSystem` |
33: | 范围 Buff | `Skill_EffectSystem` → `AICommonLogic.TriggerBuff` |
34: | 撒道具 | `Skill_DropItemSystem` → `CommonLogic.ThrowingItem` |
35: | 碰撞 Buff | `Skill_TouchEffectSystem` + `TouchEffectSystem` |
36: | 按掉血释放 | 行为树 `SkillAction` 递归解析 `SkillType.DoSkill_ByBlood` |
37: | 预览 | `AddTarget` / `ShowSeek` + `TrackMarkSystem` |
38: | UI | `SkillViewItem` 读 `SkillInfo.skills[0]` 和 `SkillCDComponent` |
39: | 被动计数 | `SkillSystem`（走 5 格/放 5 个泡泡触发飞镖），与技能配置无关 |
40: 
41: ### 1.2 现有问题
42: 
43: 1. 技能释放时机被 CD 状态机绑死，行为树无法直接控制单个技能的节奏。
44: 2. 技能实体常驻，`SkillInfo` 维护 `List<Game.Entity>`，快照和清理都复杂。
45: 3. `areaFilter / areaShape / teamType` 只有阵型/范围技能使用，撒道具、碰撞、按掉血技能完全用不到。
46: 4. `Skill_ShapeSystem` 读 owner 方向，实际阵型不旋转；预览却旋转，表现不一致。
47: 5. `areaShape = 0` 会空引用。
48: 6. `SkillLogic.EnterSkill`、`RoleEffectSystem`、旧时间线注释代码都是死代码。
49: 
50: ---
51: 
52: ## 2. 新架构
53: 
54: ```text
55: 行为树 / 其他系统
56:         │
57:         ▼
58: SkillService.Cast(caster, skillId)
59:         │
60:         ├─ 校验施法者、配置、类型
61:         ├─ ByBlood：解析成子技能 ID 后递归释放
62:         ├─ 创建临时施法实体（SkillCastEntity）
63:         │      ├─ OwnerUID
64:         │      ├─ SkillConfig
65:         │      ├─ SkillTimeLine
66:         │      ├─ SkillTarget / SkillDirection（按需）
67:         │      └─ Skill_TouchEffect（碰撞类）
68:         └─ 时间线由 SkillTimeLineSystem 统一 tick，播完销毁实体
69: 
70: SkillAutoCastSystem
71:         └─ 只处理 autoUse = 1 的技能，按 cd 循环调用 UseSkill
72: ```
73: 
74: ### 2.1 技能释放载体
75: 
76: - 每次 `UseSkill` 创建一个临时技能实体。
77: - 实体只活一次施法，时间线结束、被打断、施法者销毁时销毁。
78: - 不再为每个技能创建常驻 Entity，不再需要 `SkillInfo.skills` 存 Entity。
79: - 同一个施法者允许不同技能并行；同一个 `skillId` 同时只允许一个施法实例（避免行为树/自动系统重复触发）。
80: 
81: ### 2.2 自动释放
82: 
83: - `autoUse = 1` + `cd > 0`：`SkillAutoCastSystem` 维护每个技能的计时器，到点调用 `UseSkill`。
84: - `autoUse = 0`：代码不自动释放；行为树通过 `SkillAction` 调用 `UseSkill`，节奏由行为树控制。
85: - `cd` 字段保留，但只用于 `autoUse = 1`；手动释放不检查 CD。
86: 
87: ---
88: 
89: ## 3. 对外调用
90: 
91: ### 3.1 SkillService 类
92: 
93: 新增 `ECS/Services/SkillService.cs`：
94: 
95: ```csharp
96: public sealed class SkillService
97: {
98:     /// <summary>释放技能。所有 Entity 都可以调用。</summary>
99:     public bool Cast(Game.Entity caster, int skillId, SkillCastSource source = SkillCastSource.Manual);
100: 
101:     /// <summary>打断该施法者所有正在释放的技能。</summary>
102:     public void Interrupt(Game.Entity caster);
103: 
104:     /// <summary>是否有正在释放的技能。</summary>
105:     public bool IsCasting(Game.Entity caster, int skillId = 0);
106: 
107:     /// <summary>是否处于时间线推进中（不包含等待碰撞）。</summary>
108:     public bool IsBusy(Game.Entity caster);
109: 
110:     /// <summary>是否有正在等待碰撞触发的碰撞类技能。</summary>
111:     public bool IsTouchActive(Game.Entity caster);
112: }
113: 
114: public enum SkillCastSource
115: {
116:     Manual = 0,   // 行为树 / 其他系统调用
117:     Auto = 1,     // SkillAutoCastSystem 调用
118: }
119: ```
120: 
121: ### 3.2 服务注册
122: 
123: `ECS/Components/ServiceComponent.cs` 增加：
124: 
125: ```csharp
126: [Context(typeof(GameContext)), Unique, ReplaySnapshotIgnore]
127: public sealed class SkillServiceComponent : IComponent
128: {
129:     public SkillService instance;
130: }
131: ```
132: 
133: `ECS/Features/NetSyncLogicSystems.cs` 的 `InitService` 注册：
134: 
135: ```csharp
136: game.ReplaceSkillService(new SkillService(game));
137: ```
138: 
139: ### 3.3 Entity 调用方式
140: 
141: 新增扩展方法，任何 Entity 都能直接调用：
142: 
143: ```csharp
144: public static class SkillEntityExtensions
145: {
146:     public static bool UseSkill(this Game.Entity caster, GameContext context, int skillId)
147:     {
148:         return context.GetSkillService().instance.Cast(caster, skillId);
149:     }
150: 
151:     public static bool UseSkill(this Game.Entity caster, GameContext context, int skillId, SkillCastSource source)
152:     {
153:         return context.GetSkillService().instance.Cast(caster, skillId, source);
154:     }
155: }
156: ```
157: 
158: 使用示例：
159: 
160: ```csharp
161: // 行为树 / 任意系统
162: aiPlayer.UseSkill(_context, 1003);
163: 
164: // 自动系统
165: caster.UseSkill(_context, skillId, SkillCastSource.Auto);
166: ```
167: 
168: ### 3.4 `SkillService.Cast` 流程
169: 
170: ```csharp
171: public bool Cast(Game.Entity caster, int skillId, SkillCastSource source)
172: {
173:     if (caster == null || caster.HasDestroyed()) return false;
174:     if (SkillLogic.IsInterrupted(_context, caster)) return false;
175: 
176:     SkillConfig config = _context.GetConfigService().instance.GetSkillConfig(skillId);
177:     if (config == null) return false;
178: 
179:     // 自动释放只跑 autoUse 技能；手动释放不限制
180:     if (source == SkillCastSource.Auto && !config.autoUse) return false;
181: 
182:     // 同一个技能同时只允许一个施法实例
183:     if (IsCasting(caster, skillId)) return false;
184: 
185:     SkillType type = (SkillType)config.Type;
186:     if (type == SkillType.DoSkill_ByBlood)
187:         return CastByBlood(caster, config);   // 解析后递归 Cast
188: 
189:     if (!SkillTimeLineFactory.IsSupported(type)) return false;
190: 
191:     Game.Entity cast = _context.CreateEntity();
192:     cast.AddUID(UidUtils.Uid);
193:     cast.AddOwnerUID(caster.GetUID().value);
194:     cast.AddSkillConfig(config);
195:     cast.AddSkillTarget(SeekType.None, new ulong[0], new FixVector2[0]);
196:     cast.AddSkillDirection(MoveDirectionType.None);
197: 
198:     if (caster.HasTeam()) cast.AddTeam(caster.GetTeam().value);
199:     else cast.AddTeam(TeamEnum.None);
200: 
201:     if (caster.HasGridID()) cast.AddGridID(caster.GetGridID().value);
202:     if (caster.HasPosition()) cast.AddPosition(caster.GetPosition().value);
203: 
204:     SkillTimeLine line = SkillTimeLineFactory.Build(_context, cast);
205:     cast.AddSkillTimeLine(
206:         SkillCastState.Running,
207:         Fix.zero,
208:         line.TotalTime,
209:         0,
210:         line);
211: 
212:     // 类型特有初始化：碰撞类加 Skill_TouchEffect
213:     SkillTimeLineFactory.InitCast(_context, cast, config);
214: 
215:     cast.AddUnitType(UnitType.Skill);
216: 
217:     OnCastStarted(caster, config);
218:     return true;
219: }
220: ```
221: 
222: `OnCastStarted`：
223: 
224: - 给 owner 的 `AIBehavior.behaviorTree.SendEvent(AIConstant.DoSkillTrigger)`，保持旧行为树能收到“开始放技能”事件。
225: 
226: ---
227: 
228: ## 4. 数据结构
229: 
230: ### 4.1 `SkillInfoComponent`
231: 
232: 改成只存技能 ID，不再存 Entity：
233: 
234: ```csharp
235: [Context(typeof(GameContext))]
236: public sealed class SkillInfoComponent : IComponent
237: {
238:     public List<int> skillIds;
239: }
240: ```
241: 
242: - `AddSkill` 只解析配置里的 `skills` 字符串成 ID 列表。
243: - 不再创建常驻技能实体。
244: 
245: ### 4.2 `SkillAutoCastComponent`
246: 
247: ```csharp
248: [Context(typeof(GameContext))]
249: public sealed class SkillAutoCastComponent : IComponent
250: {
251:     public List<SkillAutoEntry> skills;
252: }
253: 
254: public sealed class SkillAutoEntry
255: {
256:     public int skillId;
257:     public Fix cdTime;
258:     public Fix runTime;
259: }
260: ```
261: 
262: - 创建 Entity 时，从 `SkillInfo.skillIds` 里筛出 `autoUse == true && Cd > 0` 的技能。
263: - `SkillAutoCastSystem` 只 tick 这个组件。
264: - 图腾、蛇身、Boss 的旧自动技能都靠它保留。
265: - `autoUse = false` 的技能不会进入该列表。
266: 
267: ### 4.3 临时施法实体组件
268: 
269: ```csharp
270: [Context(typeof(GameContext))]
271: public sealed class SkillTimeLineComponent : IComponent
272: {
273:     public SkillCastState state;
274:     public Fix timer;
275:     public Fix totalTime;
276:     public int nextIndex;
277: 
278:     [ReplaySnapshotIgnore]
279:     public SkillTimeLine line;
280: }
281: 
282: public enum SkillCastState
283: {
284:     Running = 0,
285:     WaitingTouch = 1,
286: }
287: ```
288: 
289: - 没有 CD、没有 Ready/Doing/后摇状态。
290: - `line` 是运行时委托表，快照后按配置重建。
291: - 施法结束直接销毁实体，不需要回到某个状态。
292: 
293: ### 4.4 `SkillTimeLine`
294: 
295: ```csharp
296: public sealed class SkillTimeLine
297: {
298:     private readonly List<SkillTimeEvent> events = new List<SkillTimeEvent>(8);
299: 
300:     public int Count => events.Count;
301:     public SkillTimeEvent this[int index] => events[index];
302:     public Fix TotalTime { get; private set; }
303: 
304:     public void Clear()
305:     {
306:         events.Clear();
307:         TotalTime = Fix.zero;
308:     }
309: 
310:     public void Add(Fix time, Action action, string name = null)
311:     {
312:         events.Add(new SkillTimeEvent
313:         {
314:             time = time,
315:             action = action,
316:             order = events.Count,
317:             name = name,
318:         });
319:     }
320: 
321:     public void SetTotalTime(Fix time) { TotalTime = time; }
322: 
323:     public void Sort()
324:     {
325:         events.Sort((a, b) =>
326:         {
327:             if (a.time < b.time) return -1;
328:             if (a.time > b.time) return 1;
329:             return a.order.CompareTo(b.order);
330:         });
331:     }
332: }
333: 
334: public struct SkillTimeEvent
335: {
336:     public Fix time;
337:     public Action action;
338:     public int order;
339:     public string name;
340: }
341: ```
342: 
343: ---
344: 
345: ## 5. 时间线 Builder
346: 
347: ### 5.1 基类
348: 
349: ```csharp
350: public abstract class SkillItem_Base
351: {
352:     protected readonly GameContext _context;
353:     protected readonly Game.Entity _skill;
354:     protected readonly SkillConfig _config;
355:     protected readonly SkillTimeLine _timeLine = new SkillTimeLine();
356: 
357:     protected readonly Fix ForwardTime;   // dotime[0]
358:     protected readonly Fix DoingTime;     // dotime[1]
359:     protected readonly Fix BackTime;      // dotime[2]
360: 
361:     protected bool isRotate = false;      // 阵型/范围是否按方向旋转，默认关闭
362: 
363:     protected SkillItem_Base(GameContext context, Game.Entity skill) { ... }
364: 
365:     public SkillTimeLine Build()
366:     {
367:         _timeLine.Clear();
368: 
369:         _timeLine.Add(0, PlayAudioPre);
370:         _timeLine.Add(ForwardTime, PlayAudioDo);
371:         _timeLine.Add(ForwardTime + DoingTime, OnReleaseEnd);
372: 
373:         InitTimeLine();
374:         _timeLine.SetTotalTime(ForwardTime + DoingTime + BackTime);
375:         _timeLine.Sort();
376:         return _timeLine;
377:     }
378: 
379:     protected abstract void InitTimeLine();
380: }
381: ```
382: 
383: ### 5.2 各类型实现
384: 
385: ```csharp
386: public sealed class SkillItem_Shape : SkillItem_Base
387: {
388:     protected override void InitTimeLine()
389:     {
390:         _timeLine.Add(0, LockTarget);
391:         _timeLine.Add(ForwardTime, SpawnShape);
392:     }
393: }
394: 
395: public sealed class SkillItem_Effect : SkillItem_Base
396: {
397:     protected override void InitTimeLine()
398:     {
399:         _timeLine.Add(0, LockTarget);
400:         _timeLine.Add(ForwardTime, TriggerAreaEffect);
401:     }
402: }
403: 
404: public sealed class SkillItem_DropItem : SkillItem_Base
405: {
406:     protected override void InitTimeLine()
407:     {
408:         _timeLine.Add(ForwardTime, DropItems);
409:     }
410: }
411: 
412: public sealed class SkillItem_Touch : SkillItem_Base
413: {
414:     protected override void InitTimeLine()
415:     {
416:         _timeLine.Add(ForwardTime, EnableTouch);
417:         _timeLine.Add(ForwardTime, WaitTouch);
418:     }
419: }
420: ```
421: 
422: ### 5.3 通用动作
423: 
424: | 方法 | 作用 | 对应旧代码 |
425: |---|---|---|
426: | `PlayAudioPre` | 播 `audio_pre` | `_Enter_ForwardSway` |
427: | `PlayAudioDo` | 播 `audio_do` | `_Enter_Doing` |
428: | `LockTarget` | 解析 `param`、选目标、写方向、预览 | `AddTarget` + `ShowSeek` |
429: | `ShowSeek` | 创建 TrackMark 预览 | `ShowSeek` |
430: | `SpawnShape` | 调 `SkillLogic.AddShape` | `Skill_ShapeSystem.Enter_Doing` |
431: | `TriggerAreaEffect` | 取范围内角色并 `TriggerBuff` | `Skill_EffectSystem.Enter_Doing` |
432: | `DropItems` | 解析 `args` 并 `ThrowingItem` | `Skill_DropItemSystem.Enter_Doing` |
433: | `EnableTouch` | 同步 owner 格子并 `canTrigger = true` | `Skill_TouchEffectSystem.Enter_Doing` |
434: | `WaitTouch` | `SkillCastState = WaitingTouch` | `Tick_Ready` 等待 |
435: | `FollowOwnerGrid` | 等待期间跟 owner 格子 | `Skill_TouchEffectSystem.Tick_Execute` |
436: | `OnReleaseEnd` | 释放结束的公共钩子（当前为空，预留） | `_Enter_BackSway` |
437: 
438: > `LockTarget / ShowSeek / SpawnShape / TriggerAreaEffect` 都带 `isRotate` 参数。默认 `false` 时预览、阵型生成、范围判定都不旋转。
439: 
440: ---
441: 
442: ## 6. 统一驱动 System
443: 
444: ### 6.1 `SkillTimeLineSystem`
445: 
446: ```csharp
447: public sealed class SkillTimeLineSystem : IExecuteSystem
448: {
449:     private readonly GameContext _context;
450:     private readonly Fix _deltaTime = (Fix)ClientConfig.ClientLogicFrameDeltaSec;
451: 
452:     public void Execute()
453:     {
454:         if (_context.GetGameProgress().value != GameProgressState.InGame) return;
455: 
456:         var entities = _context.GetGroup(GameSkillTimeLineMatcher.SkillTimeLine).GetEntities();
457:         for (int i = 0; i < entities.Length; i++)
458:         {
459:             Game.Entity cast = entities[i];
460:             if (cast.HasDestroyed()) continue;
461: 
462:             if (SkillLogic.IsInterrupted(_context, cast))
463:             {
464:                 DestroyCast(cast);
465:                 continue;
466:             }
467: 
468:             var com = cast.GetSkillTimeLine();
469:             if (com.state == SkillCastState.WaitingTouch)
470:             {
471:                 SkillActions.FollowOwnerGrid(_context, cast);
472:                 continue;
473:             }
474: 
475:             com.timer += _deltaTime;
476:             DispatchDueEvents(cast, com);
477: 
478:             if (com.state != SkillCastState.Running) continue;
479:             if (com.nextIndex >= com.line.Count && com.timer >= com.totalTime)
480:                 DestroyCast(cast);
481:         }
482:     }
483: }
484: ```
485: 
486: `DispatchDueEvents`：
487: 
488: ```csharp
489: while (com.nextIndex < com.line.Count && com.line[com.nextIndex].time <= com.timer)
490: {
491:     SkillTimeEvent evt = com.line[com.nextIndex];
492:     com.nextIndex++;
493:     evt.action?.Invoke();
494: 
495:     if (com.state != SkillCastState.Running) return;
496: }
497: ```
498: 
499: `DestroyCast`：
500: 
501: ```csharp
502: private void DestroyCast(Game.Entity cast)
503: {
504:     if (cast.HasSkill_TouchEffect())
505:     {
506:         var touch = cast.GetSkill_TouchEffect();
507:         cast.ReplaceSkill_TouchEffect(touch.buffType, touch.args, false);
508:     }
509: 
510:     if (!cast.HasDestroyed())
511:         cast.AddDestroyed();
512: }
513: ```
514: 
515: ### 6.2 打断
516: 
517: 统一判断：
518: 
519: ```csharp
520: public static bool IsInterrupted(GameContext context, Game.Entity casterOrCast)
521: {
522:     Game.Entity owner = casterOrCast;
523:     if (casterOrCast.HasOwnerUID())
524:         owner = context.GetEntityFactoryService().instance.GetEntity(casterOrCast.GetOwnerUID().value);
525: 
526:     if (owner == null || owner.HasDestroyed()) return true;
527: 
528:     if (owner.HasRoleState())
529:     {
530:         switch (owner.GetRoleState().value)
531:         {
532:             case RoleState.Death:
533:             case RoleState.TryTrapped:
534:             case RoleState.Trapped:
535:             case RoleState.Yhc:
536:                 return true;
537:         }
538:     }
539: 
540:     if (owner.HasBuffPetrify()) return true;
541: 
542:     return false;
543: }
544: ```
545: 
546: - 每次 tick 施法实体时检查。
547: - 施法者死亡/被困/石化 → 直接销毁施法实体。
548: - 已经结算的阵型/Buff/道具不回滚。
549: - `SkillService.Interrupt(caster)` 供 `EntityDestroySystem` / `AIBloodSystem` 主动调用，遍历该施法者的施法实体并销毁。
550: - 自动释放的 CD 在施法开始时已经重置，所以打断后下一次仍按完整 CD。
551: 
552: ### 6.3 `SkillAutoCastSystem`
553: 
554: ```csharp
555: public sealed class SkillAutoCastSystem : IExecuteSystem
556: {
557:     private readonly GameContext _context;
558:     private readonly Fix _deltaTime = (Fix)ClientConfig.ClientLogicFrameDeltaSec;
559: 
560:     public void Execute()
561:     {
562:         if (_context.GetGameProgress().value != GameProgressState.InGame) return;
563: 
564:         var owners = _context.GetGroup(GameSkillAutoCastMatcher.SkillAutoCast).GetEntities();
565:         for (int i = 0; i < owners.Length; i++)
566:         {
567:             Game.Entity owner = owners[i];
568:             if (owner.HasDestroyed()) continue;
569:             if (SkillLogic.IsInterrupted(_context, owner)) continue;
570: 
571:             var com = owner.GetSkillAutoCast();
572:             for (int j = 0; j < com.skills.Count; j++)
573:             {
574:                 SkillAutoEntry entry = com.skills[j];
575:                 if (entry.cdTime <= 0) continue;
576: 
577:                 // 技能释放中不推进 CD，释放结束后才开始计算完整 CD。
578:                 if (_context.GetSkillService().instance.IsCasting(owner, entry.skillId))
579:                     continue;
580: 
581:                 entry.runTime += _deltaTime;
582:                 if (entry.runTime < entry.cdTime) continue;
583: 
584:                 if (_context.GetSkillService().instance.Cast(owner, entry.skillId, SkillCastSource.Auto))
585:                     entry.runTime = Fix.zero;
586:             }
587:         }
588:     }
589: }
590: ```
591: 
592: - 技能释放期间不推进 CD，释放结束后才开始计算完整 CD。
593: - 到点但释放失败（施法者被打断、同技能正在释放）时保持计时器满值，下一帧重试。
594: - `autoUse = 0` 的技能不进入此系统。
